# --- Membrane precompiled OS-deps (x86_64 linux) ----------------------------
# core-elx pulls ~13 Membrane plugins (via vendored boombox) that use
# `membrane_precompiled_dependency_provider`. At `mix deps.compile`, Bundlex
# (pinned to github tag v1.5.4) downloads one precompiled OS-dep tarball per dep
# from github.com. The Forgejo CI runner lacks github.com egress, so those
# downloads fail. We pin each tarball here (Bazel repo-fetch DOES have egress),
# stage them into the build sandbox via //build:mix_release.bzl, and patch
# Bundlex's `download/2` to copy from the staged dir by URL basename.
#
# URLs/versions are taken from each plugin's bundlex.exs `:version` option,
